OL,3,GNEWSAPhone signal map has been created
OL,4,Aby bin lorries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to map mobile signals in
OL,7,Fevery isolated part of a rural county
OL,8,Fby using bin lorries to collect data
OL,9,Fhas been completed.
OL,11,FFood waste trucks in Cornwall have been
OL,12,Fcarrying a box that measured signal
OL,13,Fstrength on each of the four main
OL,14,Fnetworks at almost every property.
OL,16,FTim Dwelly, a senior Cornwall
OL,17,Fcouncillor behind the Streetwave
OL,18,Fproject, said: "It will put pressure on
OL,19,Fthe mobile companies to up their game
OL,20,Fand do better."
